WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.480 --> 00:00:07.040
Hi, Mystery Recapped here. Today I am going&nbsp;
to explain an American crime comedy film&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:00:07.040 --> 00:00:16.080
called “Little Man.” Spoilers&nbsp;
ahead! Watch out and take care!
&nbsp;

00:00:16.080 --> 00:00:21.920
Calvin Simms is a convicted jewelry thief serving&nbsp;
prison time in Chicago. In the opening scene,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:00:21.920 --> 00:00:26.480
he orders a fellow inmate to count the number&nbsp;
of pull-ups for him. By the looks of it,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:00:26.480 --> 00:00:32.400
Calvin is a tough guy, respected by all the&nbsp;
inmates. On the day Calvin is let free, he walks&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:00:32.400 --> 00:00:38.080
out of the prison and reveals that he suffers&nbsp;
from dwarfism and is barely three feet tall. 
&nbsp;

00:00:38.080 --> 00:00:43.120
His friend and fellow thief Percy picks him&nbsp;
up, accidentally hitting him with the car door&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:00:43.120 --> 00:00:48.960
while he is at it. Percy doesn’t waste time before&nbsp;
informing Calvin of their next heist. A dangerous&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:00:48.960 --> 00:00:54.560
gang leader Walken has appointed Percy to steal&nbsp;
a diamond from a jewelry shop for a hundred&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:00:54.560 --> 00:01:00.000
thousand dollars. Calvin, who thoroughly enjoyed&nbsp;
his time in prison, doesn't care about being&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:01:00.000 --> 00:01:05.440
convicted again. Hence, he accepts the deal. 
Following that, we are introduced to the Edward&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:01:05.440 --> 00:01:10.720
couple. The husband Darryl is a family man who&nbsp;
wants to have a child as soon as possible. His&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:01:10.720 --> 00:01:16.640
wife Vanessa is also keen on starting a family but&nbsp;
wants to prioritize work for the next few years.&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:01:16.640 --> 00:01:21.040
The couple is at a restaurant where Vanessa&nbsp;
says she has good news to share with Darryl.&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:01:21.040 --> 00:01:25.920
Not giving her a chance to disclose what exactly&nbsp;
the news is, Darryl announces that she is&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:01:25.920 --> 00:01:31.200
pregnant to the rest of the restaurant. Everyone&nbsp;
claps and cheers for the couple while Vanessa&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:01:31.200 --> 00:01:36.960
embarrassingly claims that it is not the case.&nbsp;
The good news is that she got promoted at work.&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:01:36.960 --> 00:01:41.600
A disheartened Darryl congratulates her&nbsp;
which doesn’t go unnoticed to Vanessa.&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:01:41.600 --> 00:01:45.360
Recently, there has been a rift in the couple’s&nbsp;
relationship because of their differences.
&nbsp;

00:01:46.320 --> 00:01:51.360
Somewhere else, Calvin and Percy go to a jewelry&nbsp;
shop to steal the diamond. Percy puts Calvin in&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:01:51.360 --> 00:01:56.560
a bag and takes him inside. While he distracts&nbsp;
the store manager, Calvin swiftly goes under&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:01:56.560 --> 00:02:01.760
the display and steals the diamond. Everything&nbsp;
goes according to the plan until a chihuahua&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:02:01.760 --> 00:02:07.520
chases after Calvin and gets inside the bag with&nbsp;
him. The dog owner freaks out, after hearing it&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:02:07.520 --> 00:02:12.720
bark from inside Percy’s bag. As the burglars&nbsp;
run away, the store manager notices the missing&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:02:12.720 --> 00:02:18.240
diamond and calls the police. Suddenly, Percy&nbsp;
comes to a halt because he feels a sharp pain&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:02:18.240 --> 00:02:23.680
in his leg. Calvin thinks he was shot but it&nbsp;
turns out that he pulled a muscle. The duo runs&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:02:23.680 --> 00:02:29.280
into a convenience store to hide while still being&nbsp;
followed by the police. Coincidently, the Edward&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:02:29.280 --> 00:02:35.200
couple is also at the store, arguing as usual.&nbsp;
In a moment of panic, Calvin puts the diamond in&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:02:35.200 --> 00:02:40.800
Vanessa’s bag to not be caught with it.
A while later, the policemen go away,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:02:40.800 --> 00:02:46.080
thinking that they lost the thieves. After that,&nbsp;
Calvin and Percy follow the couple to their home.&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:02:46.080 --> 00:02:51.520
In the next scene, we are introduced to Vanessa’s&nbsp;
father, Pops. He is living with the couple because&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:02:51.520 --> 00:02:56.640
of his old age. Darryl and Pop hardly ever get&nbsp;
along because pop thinks Darryl is unworthy of&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:02:56.640 --> 00:03:01.520
his daughter. Even now, he comments how Darryl&nbsp;
cannot get his daughter pregnant because he&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:03:01.520 --> 00:03:09.120
has “no bullets in his chamber”. Vanessa settles&nbsp;
their argument and is definite that she will only&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:03:09.120 --> 00:03:14.720
have a baby when she is ready. Outside, Percy&nbsp;
gets ready with a gun to get the diamond back&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:03:14.720 --> 00:03:20.000
but Calvin insists they need to think of a better&nbsp;
plan. A lady pushing a stroller gives Percy&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:03:20.000 --> 00:03:26.320
a genius idea. The next day, Calvin shaves his&nbsp;
beard and gets inside a basket to pose as a baby.&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:03:26.320 --> 00:03:31.440
Percy keeps him outside the couple’s door and runs&nbsp;
away, hoping that they will take Calvin in.
&nbsp;

00:03:31.440 --> 00:03:34.640
When Darryl comes outside,&nbsp;
Calvin imitates a baby’s noise&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:03:40.960 --> 00:03:46.080
and the man buys into the obviously staged act.&nbsp;
They bring the baby inside and try to change&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:03:46.080 --> 00:03:51.360
his diapers. Although what’s under his diapers&nbsp;
surprises the family, they dismiss it. Initially,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:03:51.360 --> 00:03:56.320
the family calls the child services but is&nbsp;
informed that the offices won’t open until after&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:03:56.320 --> 00:04:01.280
the weekend. Their second option is to take the&nbsp;
baby to a doctor to check if he is doing alright.&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:04:01.280 --> 00:04:06.880
The doctor finds sketchy things like a tattoo&nbsp;
on the baby’s arm and a surgery scar. However,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:04:06.880 --> 00:04:10.800
he thinks the child is overall normal&nbsp;
and lets the couple take him home. 
&nbsp;

00:04:10.800 --> 00:04:14.080
When Darryl and Vanessa are busy&nbsp;
discussing what they should do next,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:04:14.080 --> 00:04:18.720
Calvin bolts outside with Vanessa’s purse.&nbsp;
But a policeman catches him on the way&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:04:18.720 --> 00:04:25.440
and hands him back to Vanessa. The baby calls&nbsp;
her mama which melts her heart so she decides&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:04:25.440 --> 00:04:30.480
to keep him until they find his parents. 
Somewhere else, Percy meets the gangster Walken&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:04:30.480 --> 00:04:35.520
who suspects they have fled with his diamond.&nbsp;
He threatens Percy to get it back in twenty-four&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:04:35.520 --> 00:04:41.360
hours or else, both he and Calvin will be&nbsp;
dead by the twenty-fifth hour. Back at home,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:04:41.360 --> 00:04:46.480
little Calvin startles Pops who mistakes him&nbsp;
for Chucky. Pops clearly doesn’t like him&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:04:46.480 --> 00:04:50.560
and his presence in the house but he is&nbsp;
ready to compromise for his daughter.
&nbsp;

00:04:50.560 --> 00:04:55.440
That evening, Vanessa and Darryl hold a party to&nbsp;
officially welcome Calvin to the family. A couple&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:04:55.440 --> 00:05:00.320
of their friends come over who at first glance&nbsp;
think Calvin is an ugly child. One friend tries&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:05:00.320 --> 00:05:06.080
to be nice and calls him adorable in a national&nbsp;
geography kind of way. Although Calvin is acting&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:05:06.080 --> 00:05:11.840
like a baby, he cannot suppress his manly urges.&nbsp;
He holds onto one of Vanessa’s friends and tries&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:05:11.840 --> 00:05:17.120
grabbing her. When she leans down to give him a&nbsp;
goodbye kiss, he even forcefully makes out with&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:05:17.120 --> 00:05:22.640
her. The couple thinks it is weird but chooses to&nbsp;
ignore it. Later at night, Calvin tries getting&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:05:22.640 --> 00:05:28.160
close to Vanessa on several occasions; first,&nbsp;
he cutely invites her to bathe with him, then,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:05:28.160 --> 00:05:32.720
he pushes her head when she tries to tickle&nbsp;
him. Before going to bed, the couple puts him&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:05:32.720 --> 00:05:37.520
inside his crib and makes him fall asleep. 
Calvin wakes up in the middle of the night and&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:05:37.520 --> 00:05:42.400
finally decides to do the work that he was there&nbsp;
for. He jumps out of the crib and goes downstairs&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:05:42.400 --> 00:05:47.920
to call Percy. While he is at it, Pops finds him&nbsp;
talking like an adult and is happy that he was&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:05:47.920 --> 00:05:53.680
right about the big baby. Right then, Darryl also&nbsp;
wakes up but he doesn’t believe pop’s claims about&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:05:53.680 --> 00:05:59.040
the kid. Darryl thinks Calvin is hungry and makes&nbsp;
him a bottle. He also sympathizes with the kid&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:05:59.040 --> 00:06:04.800
and his presumably bad childhood. Calvin, who has&nbsp;
never had a father figure talk to him like that,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:06:04.800 --> 00:06:09.760
is touched by Darryl’s words. 
A while later, Vanessa and Darryl get&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:06:09.760 --> 00:06:15.680
steamy in bed. They feel slightly uncomfortable&nbsp;
because Calvin cannot stop staring at them. Still,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:06:15.680 --> 00:06:20.240
Darryl claims that the kid doesn’t know what is&nbsp;
going on and gets under the blankets. The next&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:06:20.240 --> 00:06:26.160
morning, Vanessa wakes up with a magical glow and&nbsp;
compliments Darryl on his newfound skills in bed.&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:06:26.160 --> 00:06:32.080
Darryl is confused because he didn’t do anything&nbsp;
new. Just then, Calvin is revealed to have climbed&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:06:32.080 --> 00:06:40.800
on bed sometime at night. The couple doesn’t&nbsp;
think much of it and ends the conversation.
&nbsp;

00:06:40.800 --> 00:06:45.840
The following day, Vanessa goes to work leaving&nbsp;
Darryl responsible to take care of the child.&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:06:45.840 --> 00:06:51.760
When he is busy, Calvin manages to get a hold of&nbsp;
the diamond from Vanessa’s purse. Now, he only has&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:06:51.760 --> 00:06:57.280
to think of a way to escape the household without&nbsp;
making a big fuss. Later, Darryl brings Calvin to&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:06:57.280 --> 00:07:03.200
a park for a father-son quality time. However, the&nbsp;
“quality” time is not fun for Darryl because the&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:07:03.200 --> 00:07:08.880
kid hits him in the crotch several times. When no&nbsp;
one is looking, Percy arrives at the park and asks&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:07:08.880 --> 00:07:13.600
Calvin for the diamond. But the parents notice&nbsp;
him and chase him away before he can get it. 
&nbsp;

00:07:13.600 --> 00:07:18.800
The diamond is in the diaper bag that Darryl puts&nbsp;
in the car trunk. Calvin takes the opportunity to&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:07:18.800 --> 00:07:24.880
run away with the entire car. A naive Darryl still&nbsp;
thinks that someone stole his car and his kid. 
&nbsp;

00:07:24.880 --> 00:07:30.000
He hitchhikes in a lady’s vehicle who drives like&nbsp;
there is no tomorrow. By the end of the chase,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:07:30.000 --> 00:07:34.240
Darryl is sobbing, saying that the baby&nbsp;
is not worth the risk of driving with her.&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:07:34.240 --> 00:07:39.920
A police car stops Calvin at last but believes&nbsp;
that the suspect ran away without the baby.&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:07:39.920 --> 00:07:44.560
Somewhere else, Percy goes to the gangster with&nbsp;
a random diaper bag he picked up from the park&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:07:44.560 --> 00:07:50.000
earlier. Walken digs into the bag but finds&nbsp;
dirty diapers instead of the diamond. Still,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:07:50.000 --> 00:07:55.680
the gangster gives Percy some more time to get&nbsp;
the real diamond. He secretly asks his henchmen&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:07:55.680 --> 00:08:01.280
to follow him and kill both Percy and his partner&nbsp;
if they aren’t able to retrieve the rock.
&nbsp;

00:08:01.280 --> 00:08:06.080
The next day, Darryl and his friends take Calvin&nbsp;
to an ice hockey game. When no one is looking,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:08:06.080 --> 00:08:11.040
Calvin grabs the diamond from the diaper bag. As&nbsp;
Darryl turns to him, he quickly puts the rock in&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:08:11.040 --> 00:08:17.680
his mouth and swallows it to not get caught. The&nbsp;
game goes well until Calvin catcalls a server and&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:08:17.680 --> 00:08:23.360
gets Darryl in trouble. On returning home, the&nbsp;
couple puts Calvin to sleep and decides to throw&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:08:23.360 --> 00:08:28.800
him a birthday party the following day. At the&nbsp;
party, Calvin is bored out of his mind. However,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:08:28.800 --> 00:08:34.160
when it is time to cut the cake, he gets emotional&nbsp;
because no one has ever shown him this much love.&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:08:34.160 --> 00:08:39.360
He is genuinely thankful that he got parents who&nbsp;
take such great care of him. At the same time,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:08:39.360 --> 00:08:44.800
Pops is at a diner when he sees Calvin’s face&nbsp;
in the news. He finds out the kid is actually a&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:08:44.800 --> 00:08:50.080
dwarf criminal and is ready to expose him. He&nbsp;
runs to the party and gives him a teddy bear&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:08:50.080 --> 00:08:55.200
as a present. What Calvin doesn’t know is that&nbsp;
the teddy bear has a hidden camera inside. 
&nbsp;

00:08:55.200 --> 00:08:59.760
After the birthday party, Calvin drinks a bottle&nbsp;
of laxatives to help him get the diamond out.&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:08:59.760 --> 00:09:05.040
The plan works but Vanessa finds the diamond&nbsp;
while changing his diaper. She believes that&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:09:05.040 --> 00:09:10.400
it is a surprise gift from her husband and jumps&nbsp;
up on top of him in excitement. Darryl tries to&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:09:10.400 --> 00:09:14.400
explain that the diamond isn’t from him but&nbsp;
she doesn’t give him a chance to talk. 
&nbsp;

00:09:14.400 --> 00:09:19.120
They go to dinner that night, leaving Pops&nbsp;
to babysit Calvin. After the couple leaves,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:09:19.120 --> 00:09:24.160
he pretends to play with Calvin and throws him&nbsp;
to the ground. Eventually, Calvin has to come&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:09:24.160 --> 00:09:30.400
clean to him but he threatens pops to not tell&nbsp;
anyone. Meanwhile, in the restaurant, Vanessa&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:09:30.400 --> 00:09:36.480
tells Darryl that she is ready to adopt Calvin and&nbsp;
make him their own. They excitedly return home,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:09:36.480 --> 00:09:41.760
only to find pops strangling Calvin. Horrified&nbsp;
by the action, they kick him out of the house&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:09:41.760 --> 00:09:46.720
and take Calvin to his room. Before being&nbsp;
pulled away, pops tells his daughter to look&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:09:46.720 --> 00:09:51.867
at the teddy because he knows everything.
Darryl checks the stuffed toy and finds out it&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:09:51.867 --> 00:09:56.640
is actually a camera. He connects it to the TV&nbsp;
and discovers a recording of Calvin admitting&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:09:56.640 --> 00:10:02.720
the truth. He immediately heads to the bedroom&nbsp;
only to find that Calvin has already run away.&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:10:02.720 --> 00:10:08.320
In the following scene, Calvin and Percy are back&nbsp;
together celebrating that they got the diamond.&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:10:08.320 --> 00:10:12.960
Percy reveals that the gangsters are after Darryl&nbsp;
and his family because they think the couple&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:10:12.960 --> 00:10:18.720
stole the stone. Realizing that the family is in&nbsp;
danger, Calvin returns to help them. Meanwhile,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:10:18.720 --> 00:10:24.480
Vanessa leaves to look for her father. When Darryl&nbsp;
is alone, Walken and two of his henchmen come to&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:10:24.480 --> 00:10:29.840
the house and hold him hostage. Just then,&nbsp;
Calvin arrives and pretends to be a child.&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:10:29.840 --> 00:10:34.400
Because the henchmen underestimate him, he&nbsp;
manages to beat them up. At the same time,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:10:34.400 --> 00:10:39.520
Darryl fights Walken. The fight goes on for quite&nbsp;
a while before the police arrive at the scene. 
&nbsp;

00:10:39.520 --> 00:10:44.720
They arrest the criminals and ask Darryl about the&nbsp;
kid. Darryl feels indebted to Calvin for coming&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:10:44.720 --> 00:10:50.320
to help him, so he saves him from the police. They&nbsp;
are also informed that they will receive a hundred&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:10:50.320 --> 00:10:55.440
thousand dollars for helping the police find the&nbsp;
diamond. When the two are left alone in the house,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:10:55.440 --> 00:11:01.680
Calvin thanks Darryl for everything and wishes him&nbsp;
farewell. But when he reaches outside, he starts&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:11:01.680 --> 00:11:06.720
crying at the thought that he will never have a&nbsp;
family again. Darryl feels bad and is genuinely&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:11:06.720 --> 00:11:14.960
sad that Calvin has to go. At last, he makes the&nbsp;
decision to keep Calvin as a family member.
&nbsp;

00:11:14.960 --> 00:11:19.680
In the ending scene, Calvin and pops are playing&nbsp;
with Vanessa’s newborn kid. To everyone’s&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:11:19.680 --> 00:11:24.960
surprise, the kid looks exactly like Calvin. 
